<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n85068" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολύ-μηλος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
		(fem. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-μήλη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Suid.
				</span></i>
			), (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῆλον</span> A) <i>with many
				sheep</i> or <i>goats, rich in flocks,</i> of persons, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				2.705
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				14.490
			</span></i> (never in <i><span class="en">
				Od.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				308
			</span></i>; of places, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				2.605
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				9.6
			</span></i> (where codd. have <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολύμηλος</span>
			correctly; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολύμᾱλος</span> in <i><span class="en">
				<u>O.</u>
				1.12
			</span></i>, if correct, means <i>rich in tree-fruit</i>).</div>
